    <x:String x:Key="TipWavelength">Estimated from the wave speed and the frequency (λ = c / f): emitters one wavelength apart radiate in phase along that direction. Holds for the 4th-order Laplacian; the 9-point stencil's speed varies with the frequency</x:String>
